(B) On ships having accommodation for 12 persons or less, where stairways penetrate'' more than a single deck and where there are at least 2 escape routes direct to the open deck at every accommodation level, the 'A-0' requirements of sub-subparagraph (A) may be reduced to 'B-0'. Tankers. Application. {d) (i) For tankers, only method IC as defined in sub-paragraph {i}(A) of paragraph {c) shall be used. Fire integrity of bulkheads and decks.

(ii) (A) In lieu of paragraph {c) and in addition to complying with the specific provisions for fire integrity of bulkheads and decks of tankers, the minimum fire integrity of bulkheads and decks shall be as prescribed in Tables 7 and 8 in the Third Schedule.

