(C) Windows facing life-saving appliances, embarkation and assembly stations, external stairs and open decks used for escape routes, and windows situated below liferaft and escape slide embarkation areas shall have fire integrity as required in Thble 1 in the Third Schedule. Where automatic dedicated• sprinkler heads are provided for windows, 'A-0' windows may be accepted as equivalent. To be considered under this sub~subpara­ graph, the sprinkler heads shall either be -

