(iv) Watertight doors need not be insulated. Protection of openings in machinery spaces boundaries. Application.

(5) (a) This sub-regulation shall apply to machinery spaces of category A and, where the Director considers it desirable, to other machinery spaces. Protection of open'fngs in machinery space boundaries.

